'''Nutcracker''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Nutcracker''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It requires {{Skill|fishing|18}} to be fished up. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Nutcracker''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5%|1|20|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

