== Behavior ==
The '''Nutcracker''' quickly goes towards the player to attack while in water, and very slowly if not. If the '''Nutcracker''' isn't killed quickly, it will summon  {{Stat|Health|500,000}} {{lv|25}} [[Toy Soldier|Toy Soldiers]].

When a '''Toy Soldier''' spawns, the following message appears in chat:
{{Dialogue|&6&lCRACK! &rA &cToy Soldier &fhas come to protect the &cNutcracker&f!}}

